### Get Conversation History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/conversations/conv-buyer-provider-001
x-user-id: {{buyerId}}
x-user-role: buyer
Accept: {{contentType}}

> {%
  client.test("Conversation history returned", function() {
